# Build context exclusions for `docker build` / `make docker-build`.
#
# The Dockerfile only COPYs pyproject.toml, src/, configs/ and openapi.yaml, so
# nothing here can reach the image. It is still worth excluding: the daemon
# transfers the whole context before reading the Dockerfile, and .venv/ alone is
# 870 MB. refrence/ is listed because local reference material should not end up
# in a build context even transiently.

.git/
refrence/

.venv/
venv/
env/

.env
*.pem
*.key

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
htmlcov/
.coverage
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/

.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store

tests/
docs/
terraform/
.github/
